---
title: OFS Prototype — Customer & Staff Flow (combined)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Cust as 🧍 Customer
    participant Store as Storefront App
    participant Order as 🔄 Shared Order State
    participant Staff as Staff Dashboard
    actor Emp as 🦺 Employee / Manager

    Cust->>Store: Login / Register
    Cust->>Store: Browse, add items to Cart
    Cust->>Store: Checkout (address → payment)
    Store->>Order: create order — status Placed
    Order-->>Staff: appears in Prep Queue

    Emp->>Staff: Mark Prepared
    Staff->>Order: status Planned, assign to Trip (BR-2/BR-6)

    Emp->>Staff: Assign Robot
    Emp->>Staff: Confirm load & Dispatch
    Staff->>Order: status Out for Delivery
    Order-->>Store: Track updates live

    Emp->>Staff: Mark Delivered / Failed (per stop)
    Staff->>Order: status Delivered / Delivery Failed (BR-8)
    Order-->>Store: Track updates live

    Note over Order: Order lifecycle is shared via<br/>localStorage — both apps<br/>read/write the same state
